<title>USA: McDonnell gets $283.2 mln F-15 contract.</title>
<headline>McDonnell gets $283.2 mln F-15 contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonnell Douglas Corp has received a $283.2 million U.S. defense contract for long-lead advance work on 25 F-15I attack jets for Israel, the Air Force said on Wednesday. The work is expected to be completed in May of 1999, the service said.</p>
</text>
